Time to teach you some German, guys. This is a "Maschendrahtzaun", literally translated a "mesh wire fence".
In a German court show on tv there was once a woman complaing that a snowberry bush would damage her "Maschendrahtzaun" - an entertainer used parts of this show and composed a pretty famous song - "Maschendrahtzaun". Yep.
This was a real case and her neighbour won - the bush was allowed to stay where it was and after she got famous because of the song and everybody knew the case, she moved away. The person who now owns the famous "Maschendrahtzaun" never had a problem with her neighbour or his plants.
